  "conclusions": [
    "Parser extraction is supported by screen1 on AMD7763:5/5 wins, paired ratio0.965318. This does not isolate fusion or AVX512.",
    "AVX512 sorting is the most consistent isolated SIMD improvement: vector_sort/vector_avx2 gives4/5 wins and0.992297 on AMD9V74,5/5 and0.979079 on Intel8573C. The full vector_sort configuration beats baseline in both vector and fused-screen sessions.",
