    "Rust1.90 fusion is not supported over the previous AVX512-sort/AVX2-CSV configuration: fused/vector_sort has2/5 wins, paired ratio1.007006 on Intel, and1/5,1.022173 on AMD. New compiler and source changes must not be conflated.",
    "fused_new has container ratio-of-medians0.955020 versus baseline on Intel and0.953925 on AMD. Versus old-compiler vector_sort, however, Intel has3/5 wins and paired ratio0.992325; AMD has2/5 wins and1.002180 despite an unpaired0.995157. This is not a robust demonstrated fusion gain.",
