  "selection_criteria": [
    "Use the running same-compiler production-PGO A(ed66 fused) versus B(25f02 unfused) comparison as the decisive fusion comparison. Require identical architecture flags, training corpus, output correctness and resource limits.",
    "Prioritize scorer-relevant Intel results while retaining safe AVX2 fallback. Intel8573C results support ISA availability and direction but do not prove the same effect size on the stated Cascade Lake scorer or its CPU quota.",
    "Prefer improvements whose paired median, ratio-of-medians and majority of paired runs agree, and whose effect persists beyond one ordering/outlier. Treat sub1% mixed-sign effects as unresolved rather than adding their advertised gains.",
    "If final PGO A/B remains effectively tied, prefer the simpler unfused configuration; keep the clearer sort optimization. Do not retain preload solely for a small ordinary-build median change.",
